{"1843310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Funko Fusion", "steam_appid": 1843310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4022990, 3780200, 3780210, 3307530, 3551550, 4023000, 4023010, 4023020, 3957700, 3942910, 3112750, 3462760, 3462750, 3307520, 3307540, 3172000, 3037360, 3112600, 3037350, 3361290, 3350580, 3361300, 3268220, 3268110, 3268090, 3268050, 3268230, 3268060, 3268240, 3462740, 3829370], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a pop-culture action adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funko Fusion is a fast-paced third-person action game from 10:10 Games, bringing together iconic characters and worlds from your favourite franchises, all reimagined in signature Funko Pop! style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.poster.avif?t=1775833909\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.webm?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.mp4?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore iconic worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through handcrafted levels inspired by Jurassic World, Back to the Future, JAWS, The Thing, Chucky, Battlestar Galactica, Hot Fuzz, The Umbrella Academy, Five Nights at Freddy’s, Masters of the Universe, Invincible, and more. Each world is packed with secrets, collectibles, and fan-favourite moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.poster.avif?t=1775833909\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.webm?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.mp4?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as 60+ characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and switch between over 60 playable characters from more than 20 franchises, each with their own abilities, weapons, and playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action, puzzles, and discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine ranged and melee combat with gadgets, abilities, and puzzle-solving to progress through each world and uncover hidden content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.poster.avif?t=1775833909\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.webm?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.mp4?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up online with up to four players and experience the adventure together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steam Deck Verified</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play anywhere with full Steam Deck support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a crossover built for fans and experience your favourite worlds in a whole new way!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a pop-culture action adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funko Fusion is a fast-paced third-person action game from 10:10 Games, bringing together iconic characters and worlds from your favourite franchises, all reimagined in signature Funko Pop! style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.poster.avif?t=1775833909\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.webm?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.mp4?t=1775833909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore iconic worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through handcrafted levels inspired by Jurassic World, Back to the Future, JAWS, The Thing, Chucky, Battlestar Galactica, Hot Fuzz, The Umbrella Academy, Five Nights at Freddy’s, Masters of the Universe, Invincible, and more. Each world is packed with secrets, collectibles, and fan-favourite moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.poster.avif?t=1775833909\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co